# CSV to JSON rules (inherits from ../../undefined/_RULES.un)

1. Inheritance
  - Inherit all rules from `../../undefined/_RULES.un`.

2. Entry point
  - Entry file: `_MAIN.un` in this directory.

3. Execution policy
  - Execute `python3 csv_to_json.py --path <path> --limit <limit>`.
  - If `outPath` is present in context/state, append `--out <outPath>`.
  - Convert rows to objects using header row.
